Package: travelgrid
Type: Package
Title: Measures the travel time across a landscape
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-09-01
Authors@R: person("Chris", "Littleboy", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "chris.littleboy@stir.ac.uk")
Description: Calculates travel time across a landscape.A travel-time grid is produced using information about topography, the built environment, and "target" features. This allows for many to many, many to one, one to many travel time calculations. We illustrate the method with the example of measuring the proximity to green and blue spaces in Scotland. This is an important public policy issue, particularly urban planning and health.
